library/
rulebook_cache/*
!rulebook_cache/srd_2024/

# --- Campaign data: kept out of this repo by default -------------------------
# This framework is a public repo. Campaign data (characters, the DM's secret
# arc and other spoilers, session notes) stays out of git unless you choose
# otherwise; see "Saving Campaigns" in CLAUDE.md. Delete these two lines to
# back campaigns up in this repo, ideally after making your copy a private
# repo. Either way, campaigns ignored here are NOT backed up.
campaigns
events

# --- Always ignored, even if you remove the block above ----------------------
# party/ holds the secret player-link tokens, QR codes and live feed
# (committing them would publish working join credentials); voice_registry.yaml
# is regenerated per session; the per-campaign rulebook cache is regenerable.
campaigns/*/party/
campaigns/*/voice_registry.yaml
campaigns/*/rulebooks/cache/
